  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q6n2](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q6n2) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Apr 17 2025 52km SE of Tutuyan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 0.3531 longitude 124.8385. It impacted 18540 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
